reread the charter and append\r\n  concrete checkpoints. Neutral gates, not role prose, decide acceptance.\r\nwarning: in the working copy of '.change-loop/changes.md', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it\nwarning: in the working copy of '.change-loop/plan.md', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it\nwarning: in the working copy of 'src/pyocd_debug_mcp/adapters/swd_process.py', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it\nwarning: in the working copy of '.change-loop/changes.md', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it\nwarning: in the working copy of '.change-loop/plan.md', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it\nwarning: in the working copy of 'src/pyocd_debug_mcp/adapters/swd_process.py', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
